+ * widths 256 / 128 / 64.  The camera requests ran at ~0.45 px/clk through IOVA (q10jmdp19: 2190 us per 512x1128 tile) while the
+ * physical S2 jobs ran at ~1 px/clk: this tells translation cost from DRAM contention.
